{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122304","id":4254072661,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc79j_9V","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122304","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122304.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122304.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122304","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122304/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122304/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122304/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c7aaf4916ff307e1303deef76905e46cd63ee94a","number":122304,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Skeleton3D: Fix invalid bone name error formatting","user":{"login":"veyhh","id":314995089,"node_id":"U_kgDOEsZxkQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/314995089?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh","html_url":"https://github.com/veyhh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veyhh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"﻿## Summary\n\n`Skeleton3D::add_bone()` rejected invalid bone names with:\n\n```cpp\nvformat(\"Bone name cannot be empty or contain ':' or '/'.\", p_name)\n```\n\n`p_name` was passed to `vformat()` without a `%s` placeholder, so formatting failed and the intended validation message was lost.\n\nThis change adds the missing `%s` so the invalid bone name is included in the error message.\n\n## Notes\n\n- No runtime tests were run locally because a compiled Godot binary is not available in this environment.\n- The change only affects error-message formatting; bone validation behavior is unchanged.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Call `Skeleton3D.add_bone(\"\")` and confirm the error mentions the bone name constraint (no `vformat` formatting error).\n- [ ] Call `Skeleton3D.add_bone(\"foo:bar\")` and `add_bone(\"foo/bar\")` and confirm both return `-1` with a clear error that includes the invalid name.\n- [ ] Call `Skeleton3D.add_bone(\"valid\")` and confirm it still succeeds.\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","description":"","color":"E94A26","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-11T14:26:00Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T15:04:21Z","closed_at":"2026-08-11T14:26:20Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"d5379208b60403dba0b9160a936df93aac245563","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"veyhh:fix/skeleton3d-invalid-bone-name-error","ref":"fix/skeleton3d-invalid-bone-name-error","repo":{"id":1331009178,"node_id":"R_kgDOT1WWmg","name":"godot","full_name":"veyhh/godot","owner":{"login":"veyhh","id":314995089,"node_id":"U_kgDOEsZxkQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/314995089?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https: